  <!-- CONTENT -->
  <main class="relative z-10 pt-28 pb-20 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <div class="mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black mb-4 text-[#4A3728] dark:text-[#F0E6D8]">API <span class="gradient-text">Referência</span></h1>
        <p class="text-[#8B7355] dark:text-[#B8A890] text-base max-w-xl">Acesso programático à geração de senhas do TofuPass. Sem chaves de API, sem drama de limite e sem conta.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="glass rounded-2xl p-5 mb-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-4">
        <div class="text-[#8B7355]/60 dark:text-[#B8A890]/60 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase flex-shrink-0">URL base</div>
        <div class="code-block flex-1 !p-3 !rounded-xl"><pre class="mono text-sm"><span class="tok-url">https://tofupass.com/api</span></pre></div>
      </div>

      <div class="glass rounded-2xl p-5 mb-8">
        <div class="text-[#8B7355]/60 dark:text-[#B8A890]/60 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-3">Suporte a idiomas</div>
        <p class="text-[#8B7355] dark:text-[#B8A890] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">A API usa inglês por padrão. Se você quiser senhas ou frases geradas com listas de palavras de outro idioma, adicione o parâmetro opcional <code class="text-[#4A3728]/70 dark:text-[#F0E6D8]/70 mono">lang</code> à solicitação.</p>
        <div class="code-block mb-4"><pre><span class="tok-comment"># Saída padrão em inglês</span>
curl <span class="tok-url">https://tofupass.com/api/password</span>

<span class="tok-comment"># Saída em português</span>
curl <span class="tok-url">https://tofupass.com/api/password?lang=pt</span>

<span class="tok-comment"># Frase em português</span>
curl <span class="tok-url">https://tofupass.com/api/passphrase?count=4&amp;lang=pt</span></pre></div>
        <p class="text-[#8B7355] dark:text-[#B8A890] text-sm leading-relaxed">Códigos suportados: <code class="mono">en</code>, <code class="mono">es</code>, <code class="mono">pt</code>, <code class="mono">fr</code>, <code class="mono">de</code>, <code class="mono">ja</code>, <code class="mono">zh-cn</code>, <code class="mono">ar</code>, <code class="mono">id</code>, <code class="mono">hi</code>, <code class="mono">ru</code>. Se <code class="mono">lang</code> estiver ausente, vazio ou não for suportado, a API usa inglês.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="endpoint-card rounded-2xl mb-6 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="px-6 py-5 border-b border-[#6BBF59]/10 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="method-get text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-lg mono tracking-wide">GET</span><span class="mono text-[#4A3728]/80 dark:text-[#F0E6D8]/80 font-semibold text-sm sm:text-base">/api/password</span><span class="ml-auto text-[#8B7355]/60 dark:text-[#B8A890]/60 text-xs">Obter uma senha</span></div>
        <div class="px-6 py-6">
          <p class="text-[#8B7355] dark:text-[#B8A890] text-sm mb-5 leading-relaxed">Retorna uma senha gerada criptograficamente no nível Firm. Nenhum parâmetro é obrigatório; adicione <code class="text-[#4A3728]/70 dark:text-[#F0E6D8]/70 mono">lang</code> apenas quando quiser um idioma específico.</p>
          <div class="mb-5"><div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#8B7355]/50 dark:text-[#B8A890]/50 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Parâmetros de consulta</div><div class="glass rounded-xl overflow-hidden"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 px-4 py-2 border-b border-[#6BBF59]/10 text-xs text-[#8B7355]/50 dark:text-[#B8A890]/50 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider"><div>Nome</div><div>Tipo</div><div>Padrão</div><div>Descrição</div></div><div class="param-row grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 px-4 py-3 text-sm"><div class="mono text-[#9B6DD7]">lang</div><div class="text-[#8B7355]/60 dark:text-[#B8A890]/60 text-xs pt-0.5">string</div><div class="mono text-[#E6A800] text-xs pt-0.5">en</div><div class="text-[#8B7355] dark:text-[#B8A890] text-xs leading-relaxed pt-0.5">Código de idioma opcional para as palavras geradas</div></div></div></div>
          <div class="mb-5"><div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#8B7355]/50 dark:text-[#B8A890]/50 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Solicitação</div><div class="code-block"><button class="copy-code-btn" onclick="copyCode(this, 'curl https://tofupass.com/api/password')">Copy</button><pre><span class="tok-comment"># Usando curl</span>
curl <span class="tok-url">https://tofupass.com/api/password</span>

<span class="tok-comment"># Palavras em português</span>
curl <span class="tok-url">https://tofupass.com/api/password?lang=pt</span>

<span class="tok-comment"># Usando JavaScript fetch</span>
<span class="tok-key">const</span> res = <span class="tok-key">await</span> fetch(<span class="tok-str">'https://tofupass.com/api/password'</span>);
<span class="tok-key">const</span> password = <span class="tok-key">await</span> res.text();
<span class="tok-comment">// → "!HappyTiger83"</span></pre></div></div>
          <div class="mb-5"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2"><div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#8B7355]/50 dark:text-[#B8A890]/50 uppercase tracking-widest">Resposta</div><span class="status-200 text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-bold mono">200 OK</span></div><div class="code-block"><pre><span class="tok-str">!HappyTiger83</span></pre></div><p class="text-[#8B7355]/50 dark:text-[#B8A890]/50 text-xs mt-2">Content-Type: text/plain</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="endpoint-card rounded-2xl mb-6 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="px-6 py-5 border-b border-[#6BBF59]/10 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="method-get text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-lg mono tracking-wide">GET</span><span class="mono text-[#4A3728]/80 dark:text-[#F0E6D8]/80 font-semibold text-sm sm:text-base">/api/passphrase</span><span class="ml-auto text-[#8B7355]/60 dark:text-[#B8A890]/60 text-xs">Obter uma frase</span></div>
        <div class="px-6 py-6">
          <p class="text-[#8B7355] dark:text-[#B8A890] text-sm mb-5 leading-relaxed">Retorna uma frase separada por hífens gerada a partir de listas de palavras selecionadas. Controle a quantidade de palavras com <code class="text-[#4A3728]/70 dark:text-[#F0E6D8]/70 mono">count</code> e escolha o idioma com <code class="text-[#4A3728]/70 dark:text-[#F0E6D8]/70 mono">lang</code>.</p>
          <div class="mb-5"><div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#8B7355]/50 dark:text-[#B8A890]/50 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Parâmetros de consulta</div><div class="glass rounded-xl overflow-hidden"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 px-4 py-2 border-b border-[#6BBF59]/10 text-xs text-[#8B7355]/50 dark:text-[#B8A890]/50 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider"><div>Nome</div><div>Tipo</div><div>Padrão</div><div>Descrição</div></div><div class="param-row grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 px-4 py-3 text-sm"><div class="mono text-[#9B6DD7]">count</div><div class="text-[#8B7355]/60 dark:text-[#B8A890]/60 text-xs pt-0.5">integer</div><div class="mono text-[#E6A800] text-xs pt-0.5">4</div><div class="text-[#8B7355] dark:text-[#B8A890] text-xs leading-relaxed pt-0.5">Número de palavras (4–30)</div></div><div class="param-row grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 px-4 py-3 text-sm"><div class="mono text-[#9B6DD7]">lang</div><div class="text-[#8B7355]/60 dark:text-[#B8A890]/60 text-xs pt-0.5">string</div><div class="mono text-[#E6A800] text-xs pt-0.5">en</div><div class="text-[#8B7355] dark:text-[#B8A890] text-xs leading-relaxed pt-0.5">Código de idioma opcional para as palavras geradas</div></div></div></div>
          <div class="mb-5"><div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#8B7355]/50 dark:text-[#B8A890]/50 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Solicitação</div><div class="code-block"><button class="copy-code-btn" onclick="copyCode(this, 'curl https://tofupass.com/api/passphrase?count=4')">Copy</button><pre><span class="tok-comment"># Padrão (4 palavras)</span>
curl <span class="tok-url">https://tofupass.com/api/passphrase</span>

<span class="tok-comment"># Quantidade personalizada</span>
curl <span class="tok-url">https://tofupass.com/api/passphrase?count=6</span>

<span class="tok-comment"># Palavras em português</span>
curl <span class="tok-url">https://tofupass.com/api/passphrase?count=4&amp;lang=pt</span>

<span class="tok-comment"># Usando JavaScript fetch</span>
<span class="tok-key">const</span> res = <span class="tok-key">await</span> fetch(<span class="tok-str">'https://tofupass.com/api/passphrase?count=4'</span>);
<span class="tok-key">const</span> phrase = <span class="tok-key">await</span> res.text();</pre></div></div>
          <div><div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#8B7355]/50 dark:text-[#B8A890]/50 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Respostas</div><div class="space-y-3"><div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5"><span class="status-200 text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-bold mono">200 OK</span></div><div class="code-block"><pre><span class="tok-str">blooming-tiger-cosmic-leaf</span></pre></div></div><div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5"><span class="status-400 text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-bold mono">400 Bad Request</span><span class="text-[#8B7355]/50 dark:text-[#B8A890]/50 text-xs">count fora do intervalo (deve ser 4–30)</span></div><div class="code-block"><pre><span class="tok-str">count must be between 4 and 30</span></pre></div></div></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="endpoint-card rounded-2xl mb-8 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="px-6 py-5 border-b border-[#6BBF59]/10 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="method-get text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-lg mono tracking-wide">GET</span><span class="mono text-[#4A3728]/80 dark:text-[#F0E6D8]/80 font-semibold text-sm sm:text-base">/api/stats</span><span class="ml-auto text-[#8B7355]/60 dark:text-[#B8A890]/60 text-xs">Estatísticas de uso</span></div>
        <div class="px-6 py-6"><p class="text-[#8B7355] dark:text-[#B8A890] text-sm mb-5 leading-relaxed">Retorna estatísticas agregadas de uso da API do TofuPass. São contadores gerais; nenhum dado de usuário ou sessão é rastreado.</p><div class="mb-5"><div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#8B7355]/50 dark:text-[#B8A890]/50 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Solicitação</div><div class="code-block"><button class="copy-code-btn" onclick="copyCode(this, 'curl https://tofupass.com/api/stats')">Copy</button><pre>curl <span class="tok-url">https://tofupass.com/api/stats</span></pre></div></div><div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2"><div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#8B7355]/50 dark:text-[#B8A890]/50 uppercase tracking-widest">Resposta</div><span class="status-200 text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-bold mono">200 OK</span></div><div class="code-block"><pre>{
  <span class="tok-key">"generated_passwords"</span>: <span class="tok-num">12453</span>,
  <span class="tok-key">"generated_passphrases"</span>: <span class="tok-num">3821</span>,
  <span class="tok-key">"total_api_calls"</span>: <span class="tok-num">16274</span>
}</pre></div><p class="text-[#8B7355]/50 dark:text-[#B8A890]/50 text-xs mt-2">Content-Type: application/json</p></div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl p-5 border border-[#6BBF59]/15" style="background: rgba(107,191,89,0.04);"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="text-[#6BBF59] text-xl mt-0.5"><span class="inline-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="5" y="11" width="14" height="9" rx="2"></rect><path d="M8 11V8a4 4 0 1 1 8 0v3"></path></svg></span></div><div><div class="font-semibold text-[#6BBF59] text-sm mb-1">Garantia de privacidade</div><p class="text-[#8B7355] dark:text-[#B8A890] text-sm leading-relaxed">Todas as respostas da API são geradas em tempo real com RNG criptograficamente seguro. Senhas e dados de usuário nunca são registrados, armazenados ou transmitidos além da resposta imediata. Servido por HTTPS com proteção Cloudflare.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl p-5 border border-[#6BBF59]/15 mt-4" style="background: rgba(107,191,89,0.04);"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="text-[#6BBF59] text-xl mt-0.5"><span class="inline-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 19c-5 1.5-5-2.5-7-3m14 6v-3.87a3.37 3.37 0 0 0-.94-2.61c3.14-.35 6.44-1.54 6.44-7A5.44 5.44 0 0 0 20 4.77 5.07 5.07 0 0 0 19.91 1S18.73.65 16 2.48a13.38 13.38 0 0 0-7 0C6.27.65 5.09 1 5.09 1A5.07 5.07 0 0 0 5 4.77a5.44 5.44 0 0 0-1.5 3.78c0 5.42 3.3 6.61 6.44 7A3.37 3.37 0 0 0 9 18.13V22"></path></svg></span></div><div><div class="font-semibold text-[#6BBF59] text-sm mb-1">Código aberto (GPL v3)</div><p class="text-[#8B7355] dark:text-[#B8A890] text-sm leading-relaxed">Este servidor de API é open source. Audite, hospede você mesmo ou faça um fork no <a href="https://github.com/Tofu-Water-Drinker/tofupass-api" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#6BBF59] dark:text-[#7DD668] underline underline-offset-2 font-bold">GitHub</a>. O <a href="https://github.com/Tofu-Water-Drinker/tofupass" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#6BBF59] dark:text-[#7DD668] underline underline-offset-2 font-bold">site frontend</a> também. Ambos sob GPL v3; o nome TofuPass e a mascote continuam nossos, então use sua própria marca se publicar um fork público.</p></div></div></div>
    </div>
  </main>
